    {
      "source": "Combined <a href=\"../../convert/EntityReader.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>EntityReader</code></a> and <a href=\"../../convert/EntityWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>EntityWriter</code></a> and add the ability to access a <a href=\"../context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> and\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a>.",
      "translation": "合并了 <a href=\"../../convert/EntityReader.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>EntityReader</code></a> 和 <a href=\"../../convert/EntityWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>EntityWriter</code></a>，并增加了对 <a href=\"../context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> 和\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> 的访问能力。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"../../convert/DefaultTypeMapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>DefaultTypeMapper</code></a> with a cache size of 1024, using the given <a href=\"../../convert/TypeAliasAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>TypeAliasAccessor</code></a>, <a href=\"../context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> and\nadditional <a href=\"../../convert/TypeInformationMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>TypeInformationMapper</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "使用给定的<a href=\"../../convert/TypeAliasAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>TypeAliasAccessor</code></a>、<a href=\"../context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>以及额外的<a href=\"../../convert/TypeInformationMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>TypeInformationMapper</code></a>s，创建一个缓存大小为 1024 的新<a href=\"../../convert/DefaultTypeMapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>DefaultTypeMapper</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"../../convert/DefaultTypeMapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>DefaultTypeMapper</code></a> with the given cache size, using the given <a href=\"../../convert/TypeAliasAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>TypeAliasAccessor</code></a>, <a href=\"../context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> and\nadditional <a href=\"../../convert/TypeInformationMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>TypeInformationMapper</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "使用给定的缓存大小、<a href=\"../../convert/TypeAliasAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>TypeAliasAccessor</code></a>、<a href=\"../context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>以及额外的<a href=\"../../convert/TypeInformationMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>TypeInformationMapper</code></a>s，创建一个新的<a href=\"../../convert/DefaultTypeMapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>DefaultTypeMapper</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"../Parameter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>Parameter</code></a> with the given name, <a href=\"../../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a> as well as an array of\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/Annotation.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.annotation\"><code>Annotation</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "创建一个具有给定名称、<a href=\"../../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a> 以及一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/Annotation.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.annotation\"><code>Annotation</code></a> 数组的新的 <a href=\"../Parameter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>Parameter</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Executes the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/BiFunction.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>BiFunction</code></a> on the given <a href=\"../context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> and <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> based on the\ngiven type.",
      "translation": "根据给定的类型，在指定的<a href=\"../context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>和<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>上执行给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/BiFunction.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>BiFunction</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"../model/IdPropertyIdentifierAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>IdPropertyIdentifierAccessor</code></a> for the given <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> and\n<a href=\"../model/ConvertingPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>ConvertingPropertyAccessor</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的 <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> 和 <a href=\"../model/ConvertingPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>ConvertingPropertyAccessor</code></a> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"../model/IdPropertyIdentifierAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>IdPropertyIdentifierAccessor</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a> for a given <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> and <code>bean</code>.",
      "translation": "返回一个针对给定<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>和<code>bean</code>的<a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a <a href=\"../../convert/MappingContextTypeInformationMapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>MappingContextTypeInformationMapper</code></a> from the given <a href=\"../context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "根据给定的<a href=\"../context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>创建一个<a href=\"../../convert/MappingContextTypeInformationMapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>MappingContextTypeInformationMapper</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> owning the current <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>.",
