      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Base implementation of an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationEvent.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationEvent</code></a> refering to a <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>.",
      "translation": "`ApplicationEvent` 的基实现，引用了一个 `<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Value object to access <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> instances managed by <a href=\"../context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>s.",
